{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Tips and Tricks for IT Negotiation"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when talking about strategies in IT negotiations."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Understand information about people's backgrounds in spoken or written documents.   Participate in the improvement of IT contracts, establishing technical clauses that respond to the needs of the negotiating agents, based on current laws on contracting."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of a range of grammar and vocabulary, and with the appropriate level of formality and purpose, coherence and cohesion for the context.  Recognizes simple ideas on concepts on IT contracts and knowledge transfer, simulated processes of IT contracting, and technological negotiation."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Simple Present Passive in Negative Statements"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When we want to give importance to the object of a sentence or when the subject is not important or unknown, the <span class=\"strong\">passive voice</span> is used."}, {"type": "example", "content": " If agreement or a primary goal is not achieved, it might be a hint of what the relationship is going to be like."}, {"type": "example", "content": "This list is not intended to be complete, but it does mention some aspects that are not always taken into account when establishing contractual terms."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">passive voice</span></span>  is used in the <span class=\"italic\">simple present</span>   to talk about situations that occur on a regular basis and its doer is unknown or is not important. <br />  To make the <span class=\"strong\">simple present passive</span> in negative statements, the <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">to be</span></span>   verb is used in the <span class=\"italic\">present simple</span>   as the auxiliary, followed by <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">not, </span></span>   and the main verb in its <span class=\"italic\">past participle form: </span>  "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Object</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb To Be and Not</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Main verb (past participle)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Complement</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The insurance terms \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"are not \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"provided \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in the contract.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Key Areas to Software Contracts"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "It is recommended that the following items be included in a contract negotiation plan: <br /><br />  <span class=\"strong\">Software: </span> <br /> This item should include information about the functionality, licensing structure, the payments schedule, escrow of source code, Guarantee of software performance, maintenance, and support. <br /><br />  <span class=\"strong\">Hardware: </span> <br /> The hardware specifications should be so detailed so that it is possible for you to place an order with your hardware vendor. <br /><br />  <span class=\"strong\">Professional Services: </span> <br /> This section should include information of the role and responsibilities of the professional services staff. The tasks and deliverables should also be stated. <br /><br />  <span class=\"strong\">Training: </span> <br /> This item should state the information related to the support you are supposed to receive in the implementation stage. <br /><br />  <span class=\"strong\">Implementation Scope: </span> <br /> The background for the project, objectives, detailed assumptions, and a detailed project schedule are included in this important section. <br />"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "counsel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a lawyer who represents a party"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A first recommendation when negotiating IT contractual terms is to retain counsel specialized in IT contract law."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hint"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a suggestion, a clue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If agreement or a primary goal is not achieved, it might be a hint of what the relationship is going to be like."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "at the outset"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "at the beginning"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: At the outset of an IT negotiation, some contract deliverables of interest for both parties in an IT contract should be taken into account."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nearly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "almost"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's list the most common key areas to nearly all IT software contracts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "project charter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a document that states the roles and responsibilities of the parts involved"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Implementation scope, which relates to the project charter, objectives schedule and detailed assumptions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "assumption"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a supposition; something that is believed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Implementation scope, which relates to the project charter, objectives schedule and detailed assumptions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Search information about the definition of IT contract."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a conversation including the definition of IT contract. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use simple present passive in negative statements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Have your instructor to read your conversation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen attentively to your instructor's remarks."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Modify your conversation according to your instructor's remarks."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I search information about the definition of IT contract."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a conversation including the definit